OL,3,GNEWSABomb squad called to street as
OL,4,Ahomes evacuated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bomb squad has been called and homes
OL,7,Fin an Essex street evacuated after a
OL,8,Fnumber of items were found by police.
OL,10,FOfficers forced entry to a home in
OL,11,FBrentwood and arrested a man and a
OL,12,Fwoman after calls about neighbour
OL,13,Fdispute at 07:20 GMT on Friday.
OL,15,FDuring a search of the property, police
OL,16,Ffound a number of small items that they
OL,17,Fsaid needed further examination.
OL,19,FTo ensure the area is safe, Essex
OL,20,FPolice has placed a 100m cordon at
OL,21,FSawyers Grove.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
